      "content": "That's a good start. You mentioned the historical collapse into authoritarianism and the failure of state ownership as a main driver. Can you drill down more on the economic side? I want to know specifically where their math fails—like their stance on taxation or wealth redistribution—so we can frame it as being fundamentally unrealistic during the debates.",
